 "utterances": [
  {
   "start": 3.99,
   "end": 7.49,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Morning, everyone. Wednesday, fourth of March. Are we all on?"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.77,
   "end": 12.92,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Yeah, hang on, it's picked the laptop mic again."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.61,
   "end": 19.21,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "We can hear you. Bit like you're inside a biscuit tin, but we can hear you."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.93,
   "end": 24.78,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Before we start, the football last night. Honestly, what was that?"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.19,
   "end": 30.69,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Not a conversation I need before I've finished this tea."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.55,
   "end": 35.7,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "He's been remarkably quiet about football this morning, actually."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.08,
   "end": 40.93,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Ha. Right, we'll spare him. Quick updates first, then today's bits."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.32,
   "end": 43.42,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "There. Headset now. Less biscuit tin?"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.53,
   "end": 46.28,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Much better. Jamie, go on."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.33,
   "end": 51.18,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Yeah so, shift handover report's gone round. All fine with that."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.17,
   "end": 53.37,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Lovely, thanks."
  },
  {
   "start": 55.42,
   "end": 61.37,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "And Reidy asked me to pass on that the pre-use checks on the trucks are all done."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.41,
   "end": 65.21,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Cheers, Jamie. Saves me shouting over this lot."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.54,
   "end": 70.79,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Last one from me: I've finished recalibrating the sensors on the pop valve. That's sorted."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.38,
   "end": 72.58,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Nice one."
  },
  {
   "start": 73.68,
   "end": 77.53,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "My function test on the relief valve is done as well."
  },
  {
   "start": 78.67,
   "end": 79.87,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Good, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.31,
   "end": 87.21,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "And I've done the site visit at Kestrel with the contractor. Boxed that off."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.72,
   "end": 88.92,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Right, lovely."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.92,
   "end": 94.42,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Reidy, how are you getting on with the near-miss write-up?"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.85,
   "end": 103.6,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "The near miss at Injection Moulding Line 1, yeah. Made a start on it. I've got the opening bit down, but there's more to write."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.9,
   "end": 107.1,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Okay, thanks."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.34,
   "end": 114.64,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Oh, and I signed off the inspection on the GT2 Number 2 Bearing on Tuesday. That's already done."
  },
  {
   "start": 116.45,
   "end": 117.65,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Yep, understood."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.58,
   "end": 128.33,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Just an observation as well: I saw the pressure on the Line 3 Chiller dip for a few minutes. It came back on its own."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.42,
   "end": 130.82,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Without anyone touching anything?"
  },
  {
   "start": 132.22,
   "end": 138.52,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Yeah, no adjustment. Back where it was. Just mentioning what I saw, nothing I'm handing out off that."
  },
  {
   "start": 140.02,
   "end": 141.22,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Right, got you."
  },
  {
   "start": 143.51,
   "end": 148.41,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Okay, today's work. Three things, and there's a definite order to the production one."
  },
  {
   "start": 148.9,
   "end": 153.1,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yep. Sorry if there's a racket my end, I'm by the door."
  },
  {
   "start": 154.57,
   "end": 164.37,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Reidy, can you go to the hydraulics lot to pick up the replacement parts for the wrapper by 11am? That's holding production up so it needs doing first."
  },
  {
   "start": 166.59,
   "end": 174.29,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll go to the hydraulics lot and pick up the replacement parts for the wrapper by 11am. First thing for me."
  },
  {
   "start": 175.5,
   "end": 177.95,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Yeah, makes sense. No parts, no running."
  },
  {
   "start": 179.67,
   "end": 181.77,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Exactly. That collection takes precedence, Reidy."
  },
  {
   "start": 184.21,
   "end": 185.61,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Understood. That one first."
  },
  {
   "start": 186.96,
   "end": 193.26,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Priya, can you sort the permit to work and isolation for the big board today? That's fairly important."
  },
  {
   "start": 193.57,
   "end": 198.47,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll sort the permit to work and isolation for the big board today."
  },
  {
   "start": 200.75,
   "end": 203.55,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Sorry, I was going to speak—no, carry on."
  },
  {
   "start": 204.01,
   "end": 209.26,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Only saying, I've got both bits, the permit and the isolation. Not just the paperwork."
  },
  {
   "start": 210.84,
   "end": 212.94,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Yep, that's what I meant. Thanks."
  },
  {
   "start": 215.43,
   "end": 222.43,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Then Reidy, if you've got a spare minute, can you do a site visit at the warehouse with the contractor?"
  },
  {
   "start": 224.76,
   "end": 232.46,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll do the site visit at the warehouse with the contractor if I've got a spare minute. Collection comes first, though."
  },
  {
   "start": 234.74,
   "end": 240.34,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Absolutely. The warehouse visit is the spare-minute one, not something to squeeze ahead of the parts."
  },
  {
   "start": 241.43,
   "end": 243.53,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "At least the priorities are clear."
  },
  {
   "start": 245.48,
   "end": 248.98,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yeah. No trying to be in two places at once."
  },
  {
   "start": 249.89,
   "end": 253.39,
   "speaker_id": "p04",
   "speaker": "Tomasz Nowak",
   "text": "Teams makes it look possible. Factory's a bit less forgiving."
  },
  {
   "start": 254.82,
   "end": 257.27,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Right. Any questions on what we've agreed?"
  },
  {
   "start": 259.06,
   "end": 260.26,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Nothing from me."
  },
  {
   "start": 260.82,
   "end": 262.22,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "No, all clear here."
  },
  {
   "start": 263.25,
   "end": 264.45,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Same, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 265.84,
   "end": 268.29,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Lovely. We'll leave it there. Cheers, everyone."
  },
  {
   "start": 269.48,
   "end": 271.93,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Cheers. And no more football chat, please."
  }
 ],
